node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Build outputs — none are tracked; `npm run build` regenerates all three.
#
#   dist/           the UI vite bundle (WP-06). It lives at the PKG ROOT, not
#                   ui/dist, because the shell hardcodes an iframe pkg's
#                   content root to `<pkg>/dist` (`pkg_content/mod.rs:493`,
#                   `server/pkg_static.rs:211`) — a bundle anywhere else never
#                   mounts. Same convention as com.ikenga.studio's dist/, not
#                   the hand-authored com.ikenga.tasks dist/ pattern the WP-02
#                   scaffold originally followed.
#   sidecar/dist/   the bun-bundled sidecar
#   mcp/dist/       the bun-bundled MCP server
/dist/
sidecar/dist/
mcp/dist/

# WP-08: `ui/tools/history-cli.ts dump` writes a snapshot of a REAL repo's log
# here for `?live=1` dev rendering. Deliberately not tracked — a repo's history
# moves, so a committed snapshot of it is stale by tomorrow. Regenerate it.
ui/dev/
